1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 10=

8
00:00:47,039 --> 00:00:48,039
Your Highness,

9
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:50,100
Lady Zishu and General Wei

10
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,899
have vanished
in Zhao Village of An County.

11
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:55,380
I've investigated thoroughly,
but found nothing.

12
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,200
It's as if they vanished into thin air.

13
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:01,579
Who would've thought a little county

14
00:01:02,299 --> 00:01:03,920
is hiding so many powerful people?

15
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:09,040
Zhao Laizi was originally
just a local scoundrel,

16
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,599
a lecher and a gambler.

17
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,200
For some reason,

18
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,900
he suddenly became a divine physician

19
00:01:15,299 --> 00:01:16,359
and completely changed.

20
00:01:18,439 --> 00:01:20,000
Completely changed,

21
00:01:20,359 --> 00:01:21,480
and divine healing power?

22
00:01:22,379 --> 00:01:23,780
He must have a stroke of fortune.

23
00:01:25,159 --> 00:01:27,040
Ask Fairy Zhang to make a trip.

24
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:29,060
Slay any god in her way,

25
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:31,019
and crush any demon that opposes.

26
00:01:32,459 --> 00:01:34,659
She must bring Chu Yunxi back!

27
00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:36,060
Yes, Your Highness.

28
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:14,800
I have become a True Immortal.

29
00:02:15,759 --> 00:02:17,120
True Immortal stage is complete.

30
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:36,919
The next is the Golden Immortal stage,

31
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:39,039
followed by the Dao Ancestor stage.

32
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,919
I was a Dao Ancestor in my past life.

33
00:02:43,159 --> 00:02:44,199
But now,

34
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:48,840
that wretched woman
has reached the Supreme Eternity stage.

35
00:02:50,139 --> 00:02:51,439
To defeat her,

36
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:54,580
I need a better strategy.

37
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:22,479
Su Wan'er, I order you to fetch water.

38
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:27,800
With that tone of yours,

39
00:03:28,419 --> 00:03:29,699
one would think

40
00:03:29,699 --> 00:03:32,620
you're some emperor
who can order people around at will.

41
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:37,479
If I told you my identity,
you'd die of fright.

42
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:41,099
Now you've got me curious.

43
00:03:41,099 --> 00:03:42,500
Go ahead. Tell me.

44
00:03:42,939 --> 00:03:45,539
Let's see if my knees actually shake.

45
00:03:46,659 --> 00:03:47,659
You...

46
00:03:50,620 --> 00:03:52,919
You're awake, Dong.

47
00:03:53,539 --> 00:03:58,300
Did you and Hanyan
have a good talk last night?

48
00:03:59,340 --> 00:04:00,340
Not bad.

49
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,780
We had an open,
heart-to-heart talk all night,

50
00:04:03,379 --> 00:04:04,740
resolving a lot of her worries.

51
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:08,060
That's wonderful to hear.

52
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:12,280
Zhao Dong, go fetch water.

53
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,900
Watch your mouth!

54
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:17,779
Who are you to order Dong around?

55
00:04:17,779 --> 00:04:20,199
You'd better know your place.

56
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:22,300
To tell you the truth,

57
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:26,519
I am the reigning empress, Chu Yunxi!

58
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:32,560
You're really the empress?

59
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:34,519
Of course.

60
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:37,139
However, even if you beg on your knees,

61
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,699
I will not forgive you.

62
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:45,699
Dressed in such rags,

63
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,699
you sure put on quite an act!

64
00:04:49,819 --> 00:04:51,600
The mighty empress,

65
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,399
ruler of the realm,

66
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:56,899
was actually divorced by Dong.

67
00:04:57,420 --> 00:05:00,120
I could brag about this for a lifetime.

68
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,899
Though no one would believe it.

69
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:05,300
It's just too absurd.

70
00:05:06,139 --> 00:05:07,139
Su Wan'er, you...

71
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,000
What are you glaring at?

72
00:05:11,500 --> 00:05:12,720
Wanna have a staring contest?

73
00:05:14,259 --> 00:05:15,259
You...

74
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,040
Enough.

75
00:05:19,379 --> 00:05:21,199
I saw through her identity long ago.

76
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:23,459
The fallen empress.

77
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:28,920
You're really the empress?

78
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:31,860
Afraid now, aren't you?

79
00:05:32,259 --> 00:05:34,639
Tell me. How should I punish you?

80
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:38,199
Chu Yunxi, drop the imperial act.

81
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:40,800
If you frighten her,

82
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,800
I won't hesitate to paddle you.

83
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:48,500
You...

84
00:05:48,579 --> 00:05:51,300
Zhao Dong,
do you want me to gouge your eyes out?

85
00:05:52,819 --> 00:05:54,660
Your Majesty,

86
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:56,579
with a face like yours,

87
00:05:57,300 --> 00:05:58,819
I'd be a fool

88
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,500
not to look.

89
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:04,240
Besides, women dress to please
those who admire them,

90
00:06:04,860 --> 00:06:05,860
right?

91
00:06:06,939 --> 00:06:08,259
Smooth talker.

92
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:11,000
(Dong is truly amazing.)

93
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,339
(Facing the supreme empress,)

94
00:06:13,339 --> 00:06:14,540
(he doesn't flinch at all,)

95
00:06:14,819 --> 00:06:16,019
(and even teases her.)

96
00:06:16,399 --> 00:06:18,319
(Dong's incredible!)

97
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:20,300
Go fetch water, now!

98
00:06:20,439 --> 00:06:21,439
I can't stand this.

99
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,279
There's water in the vat.

100
00:06:23,339 --> 00:06:24,339
Help yourself.

101
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:28,500
How... How am I supposed
to use this muddy leftover water?

102
00:06:28,819 --> 00:06:29,819
Is there really no water?

103
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:31,660
Take another good look.

104
00:06:48,779 --> 00:06:49,779
Zhao Dong, you...

105
00:06:50,459 --> 00:06:52,360
How dare you splash me on purpose!

106
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:58,720
(Tomorrow, the magistrate
will hold the rain ritual.)

107
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:01,740
(I'll see what evil fiend
is behind all this.)

108
00:07:12,660 --> 00:07:15,319
Dong, if it doesn't rain soon,

109
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:17,800
more and more people will die.

110
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,199
(Three years of drought.)

111
00:07:24,379 --> 00:07:25,899
(The people are suffering so much.)

112
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,740
(It is my duty.)

113
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:34,180
Such is the mortal fate.

114
00:07:34,980 --> 00:07:36,740
The drought will last five years,

115
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:38,459
and Qian will fall apart.

116
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:40,220
Stop your fearmongering!

117
00:07:41,180 --> 00:07:43,839
Qian will stand forever.

118
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,740
Dynasties rise and fall all the time.

119
00:07:47,199 --> 00:07:49,279
Even you, the empress,
have fallen from grace.

120
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:52,639
Only by accepting reality
can you take the next step forward.

121
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:55,439
As long as I live,

122
00:07:55,959 --> 00:07:58,879
Qian will reclaim its glory.

123
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,639
(This vast land,)

124
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:04,199
(this mortal world,)

125
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:06,819
(to save everyone from suffering,)

126
00:08:07,060 --> 00:08:08,459
(this is the path I'll take.)

127
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,360
(By cultivating supreme merit,)

128
00:08:10,939 --> 00:08:12,680
(I will surely
defeat that wretched woman.)

129
00:08:21,404 --> 00:08:24,963
(Affection: 100)

130
00:08:35,202 --> 00:08:37,329
(Fairy Zhang, Holy Maiden of Zixia Sect)

131
00:08:40,340 --> 00:08:42,700
This rundown place
is actually protected by a formation.

132
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:45,340
Seems Zhao Laizi
did chance upon some fortune

133
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,700
and started his cultivation.

134
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:50,779
But a petty formation won't stop me.

135
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:11,759
Miss,

136
00:09:13,700 --> 00:09:14,700
are you all right?

137
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,720
Nothing.

138
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,500
I just took a fall.

139
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:25,000
(The backlash from this formation
is unbelievable.)

140
00:09:25,899 --> 00:09:27,980
(A full-force strike
from a peak Golden Core)

141
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:29,779
(is utterly ineffective.)

142
00:09:33,299 --> 00:09:34,860
I think I might have broken my leg.

143
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:38,000
Miss, could you come give me a hand?

144
00:09:38,500 --> 00:09:39,500
Okay.

145
00:09:56,157 --> 00:09:59,748
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

146
00:09:59,748 --> 00:10:02,535
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

147
00:10:03,111 --> 00:10:05,273
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

148
00:10:05,273 --> 00:10:08,119
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

149
00:10:08,119 --> 00:10:11,397
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

150
00:10:11,397 --> 00:10:13,031
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

151
00:10:13,031 --> 00:10:15,095
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

152
00:10:15,095 --> 00:10:16,631
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

153
00:10:16,631 --> 00:10:19,413
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

154
00:10:19,862 --> 00:10:21,767
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

155
00:10:21,767 --> 00:10:27,798
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

156
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:32,263
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

157
00:10:32,263 --> 00:10:35,488
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

158
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,599
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

159
00:10:38,599 --> 00:10:43,727
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

160
00:10:43,727 --> 00:10:47,255
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

161
00:10:47,255 --> 00:10:50,963
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

162
00:10:50,963 --> 00:10:52,855
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

163
00:10:52,855 --> 00:10:54,932
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

164
00:10:54,932 --> 00:10:57,463
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

165
00:10:57,463 --> 00:11:01,500
♪You met the most precious person♪

166
00:11:03,168 --> 00:11:05,031
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

167
00:11:05,031 --> 00:11:07,550
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

168
00:11:07,550 --> 00:11:08,999
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

169
00:11:08,999 --> 00:11:11,301
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

170
00:11:11,301 --> 00:11:13,271
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

171
00:11:13,271 --> 00:11:17,681
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

172
00:11:17,681 --> 00:11:19,223
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

173
00:11:19,223 --> 00:11:21,133
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

174
00:11:21,133 --> 00:11:24,407
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

175
00:11:24,407 --> 00:11:27,728
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

176
00:11:27,728 --> 00:11:29,463
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

177
00:11:29,463 --> 00:11:34,087
♪Just catch your breath first♪

178
00:11:34,087 --> 00:11:37,837
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

179
00:11:37,837 --> 00:11:41,215
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

180
00:11:41,589 --> 00:11:43,559
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

181
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:49,306
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

182
00:11:49,306 --> 00:11:52,822
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

183
00:11:52,822 --> 00:11:54,391
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

184
00:11:54,391 --> 00:11:56,701
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

185
00:11:56,701 --> 00:11:58,439
♪From laughter to devotion♪

186
00:11:58,439 --> 00:12:00,495
♪From falling to innocence♪

187
00:12:00,495 --> 00:12:02,343
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

188
00:12:02,343 --> 00:12:09,013
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
